/**
 * checkpoint-track — vendored from the UI Engine preset library (axiestudio).
 * Install: npx shadcn@latest add https://ui-engine.pages.dev/r/checkpoint-track.json
 * Source of truth: UI/ — do not edit vendored copies blindly.
